graph TD
    subgraph Clients [AI 코딩 클라이언트]
        Client[grok build / Claude Code / Cursor / Codex / Gemini CLI / ...]
    end

    subgraph Orchestrator [Orchestrator - 단일 Rust 바이너리 `fleet serve`]
        subgraph Components [진입점]
            MCP[fleet-mcp<br/>12 tools]
            API[fleet-api<br/>REST + auth /metrics]
            Dash[fleet-dashboard<br/>별도 크레이트, HTML + SSE]
            CLI[fleet-cli<br/>workers/tasks/provision/mtls/...]
        end

        Scheduler[fleet-scheduler<br/>• WorkerSelector hint+labels+model<br/>• CircuitBreaker 3-state<br/>• Dispatcher 이벤트 기반<br/>• Reconciler 30s 안전망<br/>• SessionCleanup<br/>• HealthChecker 15s]
        Transport[fleet-transport<br/>AcpTransport - ACP over WebSocket/mTLS]
        Credentials[fleet-credentials<br/>AES-256-GCM 마스터 키 암호화]
        Store[fleet-store Store trait<br/>• PgStore<br/>• migrations sqlx<br/>• LISTEN/NOTIFY]

        Components --> Scheduler
        Scheduler --> Store
        Scheduler --> Transport
        Scheduler --> Credentials
    end

    DB[(PostgreSQL)]

    Client -->|MCP JSON-RPC stdio 또는 HTTP| Components
    Store --> DB

    subgraph Provisioning [프로비저닝 - 관리자 로컬 실행]
        Provisioner[fleet-provisioner<br/>russh 기반 SSH 자동 설치]
    end
    CLI --> Provisioner

    subgraph Workers [워커 노드]
        WorkerA["fleet-worker 데몬<br/>grok agent serve 관리 + mTLS proxy + cloudflared"]
        WorkerN[fleet-worker 데몬 N]
    end

    Provisioner -.->|SSH 최초 설치/등록| Workers
    Transport <-->|ACP over WebSocket - 태스크 디스패치| WorkerA
    Transport <-->|ACP over WebSocket| WorkerN
    WorkerA -->|HTTP heartbeat + 메트릭| API
    WorkerN -->|HTTP heartbeat + 메트릭| API
